▶ ASAMA_04: replay proof, V2 token ve attempt fencing
  ✔ V2 tokens are stable for the stored nonce and change after tombstone GC (23.4511ms)
  ✔ only the same owner, proof and payload can recover a ready reservation (2.5023ms)
  ✔ legacy requestId-only records never regenerate a manage token (0.5639ms)
  ✔ a failed operation retries as a new fenced attempt while preserving its logical tokens (2.0206ms)
  ✔ expired lease takeover fences late finalize and revoke cannot be undone (2.6524ms)
  ✔ 20 simultaneous replays create one logical reservation without UNIQUE failures (2.7575ms)
  ✔ isolated PostgreSQL retries the same request id and keeps one row (1577.1545ms)
  ✔ status GET requires cookie and proof, returns ready tokens without any form fields and is no-store (13.148ms)
Belge paylaşım oluşturma beklenmeyen hata kategorisi: Error
  ✔ Blob PUT sonrası finalize hatası failed olur; aynı payload yeni path ile retry edilir (225.4535ms)
  ✔ finalize commit yanıtı kaybolursa genel hata hazır kaydı failed yapmaz (16.1312ms)
  ✔ unavailable stored key version fails closed rather than changing old token hashes (1.7402ms)
✔ ASAMA_04: replay proof, V2 token ve attempt fencing (1869.0973ms)
